cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: "equiparity: matched-pair parity ablation for equivariant materials models"
abstract: >-
  Matched-pair model builders, verification gate, and evaluation pipelines for
  quantifying when parity labelling matters in equivariant machine-learned models
  of materials. Each core is built twice from one typed configuration, differing
  only in whether its features carry parity labels, so the parity gap is measured
  rather than inferred.
type: software
